Third-party components
----------------------

This product builds against, links with, or runs the components below.
They are separate works and they keep their own licenses.
They are not covered by the Apache License, Version 2.0.

1. mORMot2 (third_party/mORMot2, synopse/mORMot2)
   Copyright (C) Arnaud Bouchez.
   License: a choice of MPL 1.1, GPL 2.0, or LGPL 2.1 with the FPC modified
   LGPL linking exception.
   This project uses the mORMot2 OpenSSL and ALPN units at build time and at
   run time. The mORMot2 checkout is a pinned external dependency. It is not
   part of the http2client source distribution.

2. h2-client-test-harness (third_party/h2-client-test-harness,
   nomadlabsinc/h2-client-test-harness)
   License: the upstream repository states no license.
   This project uses the harness only as a test tool. It runs the harness in a
   local container image. No harness code enters the http2client library or
   its binaries.

3. OpenSSL (loaded at run time from the system or from Homebrew)
   License: the Apache License, Version 2.0.
   This project loads OpenSSL through mORMot2. No OpenSSL code is included.

4. nghttp2 (the `nghttpd` and `nghttp` programs)
   License: the MIT License.
   This project uses these programs as external test tools only.

5. The Free Pascal zlib bindings (paszlib, zstream)
   License: part of the Free Pascal Runtime Library, which the Free Pascal
   project distributes under the modified GNU Lesser General Public License,
   version 2.1, with the linking exception. This project compiles against
   the bindings that ship with the compiler; it includes no Free Pascal
   source. No extra dependency is added.

Test-only files under test/certs/ are self-signed certificates that the test
scripts generate. They carry no rights and they are not for production use.
